    PumpFlowOverrideReport,  !- Variable Name 1
    CoolingtowerOutTemperature,  !- Variable Name 2
    CoolingtowerWaterFlow,   !- Variable Name 3
    FanFlowOverrideReport,   !- Variable Name 4
    CoolingtowerInTemperature,  !- Variable Name 5
    Heat Transfer;           !- Variable Name 6


